# Local agent tooling: worktrees created inside the repo, and any skills
# installed here for project scope. Deliberately all of .claude/, because
# none of it is this app's source and none of it should follow a clone.
# The 1 exception is the app's own verify skill, which Codex and agy also
# load through the .agents/skills link.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/verify-live-darbar/

